# Sportify — Updated Implementation Plan

## Goal
Build a **fully polished** Flutter prototype of the Sportify football talent discovery app — every screen complete, every widget functional, zero placeholders.

---

## Screens (7+ Screens)

| # | Screen | Description |
|---|--------|-------------|
| 1 | **Splash Screen** | Animated Sportify logo + tagline, auto-navigates to Home |
| 2 | **Discover / Home** | Branding, featured players carousel, player cards grid (photo, name, position, nationality, availability, AI Fit Score), highlight video cards, search field |
| 3 | **Player Profile** | Full profile: photo, name, position, nationality, age, height, preferred foot, availability, biography, career history, goals/assists/appearances, highlight video placeholder, AI Fit Score, "Why this player?" section |
| 4 | **AI Club Scouting** | Position selector, age range slider, preferred foot, budget slider, ranked player results with match percentages |
| 5 | **Search / Explore** | Full search with filters by position, nationality, availability — live filtering results |
| 6 | **Favorites / Shortlist** | Save and manage shortlisted players |
| 7 | **Highlight Videos** | Grid/list of video highlight cards with player info |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> All screens will be **fully implemented** with real UI, data, interactions, and animations. No empty stubs.

