## Technical Decisions

| Decision | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **State Management** | **Riverpod 2.x** | Modern, compile-safe, better testability — shows strong Flutter knowledge |
| **Navigation** | **GoRouter** | Declarative, web-friendly deep linking URLs, shell routes for bottom nav |
| **Data Layer** | **Repository pattern + Mock API Service** | Clean separation — swap mock with Laravel REST in the future |
| **Design** | **Dark theme + Emerald green + Gold** | Professional football aesthetic (pitch green + trophy gold) |
| **Fonts** | **Google Fonts (Outfit + Inter)** | Modern, clean, sporty typography |
| **Animations** | **flutter_animate + Hero** | Smooth transitions, micro-interactions |
| **Deployment** | **Flutter Web → GitHub Pages** | Free hosting, works with GitHub repo |

